  34:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \{
  35:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
  36:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * The  Clock control unit driver provides a default configuration for pll and Clock initialisation
  37:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
  38:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * In the following sections it will be described, how to integrate the driver into the application
  39:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
