  74:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \subsection IfxLld_Clock_Std_Init Module Initialisation
  75:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
  76:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * The module initialisation can be done in the same function. Here an example:
