1930:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief API to initialize the CLOCK Clock Control Unit.
1931:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * This API initialize the Sys PLL with ramp steps, BUS dividers and Per PLL for the configuration 
1932:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Note: Following SMU alarms are disabled before the PLL configuration and Cleared at the end of P
1933:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * System PLL input clock out of range
1934:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Per PLL input clock out of range
1935:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * The application should store/restore these alarm configurations if required.
1936:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * The K2 Divider Value in case of RAMP OSC enabled will be the Final K2 Divider Value
1937:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * and in case RAMP OSC is disabled, the K2 Divider value will be the initial Step Value
1938:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Note: This API cannot be called from the PPU
1939:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
1940:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \param[in] config Pointer to the configuration structure of the Clock.
1941:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
1942:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \retval  TRUE: If an error occurred during initialization.
1943:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****             FALSE: If initialization was successful.
1944:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  */
