 620:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 621:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[in] count The new value to be set for the instruction counter. 0 to 0x7FFFFFFF.
